  "description": "<p>‘SPT 4.0.x’ -&gt; ‘0.16.x.x Beta version’.</p>\n<p>the principle is very simple, see <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://github.com/sp-tarkov/server-csharp/blob/459f7d4be9502a4ca5ab07124c85199ec4e8741b/Libraries/SPTarkov.Server.Core/Utils/Watermark.cs#L113\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">server-csharp</a>. It also doesn’t require a configuration file; it directly reads the <code>compatibleTarkovVersion</code> field from <code>SPT\\SPT_Data\\configs\\core.json</code>.</p>\n",
